# (cf. memory feedback_no_cargo_test_unless_permitted). The E-47 LoRA
# ship-gate row at ordinal 0233 was inserted via stdlib-only Python alphabetical
# resort against the existing 464-row baseline + bump TOTAL_VARIANTS 464 -> 465,
# matching the regen_golden_file ALPHABETICALLY-sorted format exactly.
# E-40 Tranche B-2 follow-up: symbol_graph_event row at ordinal 0403 was
# inserted via the same stdlib-only Python alphabetical resort against the
# existing 465-row baseline + bump TOTAL_VARIANTS 465 -> 466. Subsequent
# rows (0404+) shifted by +1 ordinal.
# Tranche B-6 quad follow-up (SCHEMA_VERSION 194): inserted 4 new rows
# (contract_coding_event, mcp_authz_event, reflect_budget_soft_warn,
# tool_calibration_event) alphabetically against the existing 466-row
# baseline + bump TOTAL_VARIANTS 466 -> 470. See
# workflow/reasoning/B6-quad-tranche-decisions.md.
# Tranche B-7 triple follow-up (SCHEMA_VERSION 195): inserted 1 new row
